          "en": "Supreme People's Court\nReply on Whether a Real Estate Administration Organ May Revoke an Erroneous\nCancellation of Mortgage Registration\nFa Shi No. 17 [2003]\n(Adopted at the 1,293rd meeting of the Judicial Committee of the Supreme People's Court on 14 October 2003; promulgated by announcement of the Supreme People's Court on 17 November 2003; coming into force on 20 November 2003)\nTo the Higher People's Court of the Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region:\nThe Request for Instructions of your court on the case of the appeal by Shouzhang Mechanical and Electrical Equipment Trading (Hong Kong, China) Co., Ltd. against the cancellation of mortgage registration and the revocation of the Certificate of Other Rights over the House No. 0410, Liu Fang Ta Zheng Zi No. 0410 [1997], by the Liuzhou Municipal Real Estate Administration, and its request for the return of the Certificate of Other Rights over the House No. 0410, has been received. After study, the reply is as follows:\nA real estate administration organ may revoke an erroneous cancellation of mortgage registration.\nThis is our reply.\n17 November 2003"
